      "html": "<div class=\"ds-player\"><div class=\"ds-player-progress\"></div><button class=\"ds-play\" aria-label=\"Ouvir prévia\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M6 3v18l15-9z\"/></svg></button><div class=\"ds-player-meta\"><p class=\"ds-player-title\">Ofertas da Semana</p><p class=\"ds-player-sub\">~0:34 · Fenrir · Ding-dong de supermercado</p></div><button class=\"ds-btn-dl\">Baixar MP3</button></div>",
